// `tab part as numbers` = LilyPond's default TabStaff: fret DIGITS only, no
// stems, flags, beams, dots, rests or tuplet brackets — the rhythm is read from
// the paired notation staff above. (`tab part` alone stays full-notation.)
// Covers a beamed run, a dotted value, a rest and a triplet on the tab: none of
// their rhythm glyphs may appear on the numbers-only staff.
time 4/4
key c major
part m { instrument bass section A { c8 e g8. e16 g4 r4 | tuplet 3/2 { c8 e g } e4 c2 | } }
form main { A }
score main {
  staff m
  tab m as numbers
}
